<div class="wrap">

  <!-- HEADER -->

  <section class="header">

    <div class="brand">Web<span>Rite</span></div>
    <div class="tagline">WEBSITES THAT WORK</div>

    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p class="lead">
      Your information is used to serve you, and nothing else.
      We do not sell your data.
    </p>

    <p>
      Last Updated: November 2026. This policy explains what WebRite collects
      through webrite.net, how we use it, and the choices you have.
    </p>

    <a class="back" href="/">&larr; Back to Homepage</a>

  </section>

  <!-- PROMISES -->

  <div class="promises">

    <div class="promise">
      <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M5.6 5.6l12.8 12.8"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Never sold</h3>
      <p>We do not sell, rent, trade, or resell your personal information. Ever.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="promise">
      <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Used to serve you</h3>
      <p>We only use what you share to send your quote and work on your project.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="promise">
      <div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 4.5-3.4 8.3-8 9-4.6-.7-8-4.5-8-9V6l8-3z"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg></div>
      <h3>Your choice</h3>
      <p>Ask us anytime to see, correct, or delete the information we have about you.</p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">1. Information We Collect</h2>

  <div class="faq-group">

    <details class="faq" open>
      <summary>1.1 Information you give us</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>When you request a quote or contact us, we collect the information you choose to provide, such as:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your name and business name</li>
          <li>Email address and phone number</li>
          <li>Your current website, if you have one</li>
          <li>The plan, features, and launch timing you select</li>
          <li>Any notes you add about your business or project</li>
        </ul>
        <p>You decide what to share. If you leave optional fields blank, we simply won&rsquo;t have that information.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq">
      <summary>1.2 Information collected automatically</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>Like most websites, our hosting provider (Cloudflare) automatically processes basic technical information when you visit, such as your IP address, browser type, and the pages you request. This is used to deliver the site, keep it secure, and protect it from abuse.</p>
        <p>We do not use advertising cookies, and we do not build marketing profiles of visitors.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>

  <div class="faq-group">

    <details class="faq" open>
      <summary>2.1 What we use it for</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>We use your information only to run WebRite and serve you, including to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Prepare and send your website quote</li>
          <li>Contact you about your project by phone, text, or email</li>
          <li>Build, launch, and maintain the website you hire us for</li>
          <li>Send invoices and project updates</li>
          <li>Keep our website secure and working properly</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq">
      <summary>2.2 Text messages</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>If you agree to be contacted by text, we may send messages about your quote or project. Message and data rates may apply. You can reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time to stop receiving texts.</p>
        <p>We do not send marketing texts to numbers we did not receive directly from you.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">3. We Do Not Sell Your Data</h2>

  <div class="faq-group">

    <details class="faq" open>
      <summary>3.1 Our promise</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p><strong>WebRite does not sell, rent, trade, or resell your personal information to anyone.</strong> We do not share it with advertisers or data brokers, and we never will.</p>
        <p>This applies to everyone, including visitors, people who request a quote, and clients.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq">
      <summary>3.2 Service providers we rely on</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>To operate our business, some of your information is processed by trusted tools that work on our behalf, such as:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Cloudflare, which hosts this website</li>
          <li>Google (Forms, Sheets, and Gmail), which receives and stores quote requests and sends quote emails</li>
          <li>Text messaging providers, which deliver SMS notifications</li>
          <li>Payment processors, which handle invoices and payments</li>
        </ul>
        <p>These providers may only use your information to provide their service to us. They are not allowed to sell it or use it for their own marketing.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq">
      <summary>3.3 When we may be required to disclose information</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>We may disclose information if required by law, such as in response to a valid subpoena or court order, or when necessary to protect the rights, safety, or property of WebRite, our clients, or others.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">4. Storage, Security &amp; Retention</h2>

  <div class="faq-group">

    <details class="faq">
      <summary>4.1 How we protect your information</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>Our website is served over a secure, encrypted connection (HTTPS). Quote requests are stored in password-protected business accounts that only WebRite can access.</p>
        <p>No method of storage or transmission is 100% secure, but we take reasonable steps to protect your information.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq">
      <summary>4.2 How long we keep it</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>We keep quote requests and project records for as long as they are needed to serve you, maintain our business records, and meet legal or tax obligations. You can ask us to delete your information at any time (see below).</p>
      </div>
    </details>

  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">5. Your Choices &amp; Rights</h2>

  <div class="faq-group">

    <details class="faq" open>
      <summary>5.1 Access, correction, and deletion</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>You can ask us to tell you what personal information we have about you, correct it, or delete it. Email <a href="mailto:webritenet@gmail.com">webritenet@gmail.com</a> and we&rsquo;ll respond within a reasonable time.</p>
        <p>We won&rsquo;t treat you differently for making a privacy request.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq">
      <summary>5.2 California residents</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>If you live in California, you may have additional rights under California privacy law, including the right to know what personal information is collected and the right to request deletion. Because WebRite does not sell or share personal information for advertising, there is nothing to opt out of, but you may still contact us with any request.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq">
      <summary>5.3 Children&rsquo;s privacy</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>Our services are intended for businesses and adults. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has sent us information, contact us and we will delete it.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq">
      <summary>5.4 Changes to this policy</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The &ldquo;Last Updated&rdquo; date at the top of this page shows when it was last changed.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq">
      <summary>5.5 Contact us</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">
        <p>Questions about this policy or your information? Email <a href="mailto:webritenet@gmail.com">webritenet@gmail.com</a> or reach out through our <a href="/get-a-quote">Get a Quote</a> page.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

  </div>

  <!-- CTA -->

  <section class="cta">
    <div>
      <h2>Questions About Your Privacy?</h2>
      <p>
        Reach out anytime. We'll tell you exactly what we have
        and remove it if you ask.
      </p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn" href="mailto:webritenet@gmail.com">Email WebRite</a>
  </section>

